OL,10,G0100 Who Killed Billie-Jo?
OL,11,     FIn 1997, Sion Jenkins was
OL,12,     Fconvicted of murdering his
OL,13,     Ffoster-daughter, Billie-Jo. After
OL,14,     Fserving six years of a life
OL,15,     Fsentence, he was acquitted and
OL,16,     Freleased from prison.
